# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale gl
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [06:00, 12:00).
# Sources: Dicionario da Real Academia Galega
# (https://academia.gal/dicionario/-/termo/mana).
# The DRAG entry carries both senses in one word: "parte do dia que vai
# desde que sae o Sol ata o mediodia" and "dia seguinte ao de hoxe". The
# bare word therefore keeps its tomorrow reading and the day-part one
# fires only under an article, a demonstrative, "de" or "a".
mañá
mana
